
### 21.10. Joining Factors for Prolate Spheroidal Wave Functions

\(S_{mn}^{(1)}(c,\xi){=}\kappa_{m}^{(1)}(c)R_{m}^{(1)}(c,\xi)\)

\(\kappa_{mn}^{(1)}(c){=}\frac{(2m+1)(n+m)!\sum\limits_{r=0}^{n}d_{r}^{m}(2m+r)!/ r!}{2^{n+n}d_{0}^{mn}(c)e^{m}m!\left(\frac{n-m}{2}\right)!\left(\frac{n+m}{2} \right)!}\)

\((n-m)\) even (\(n-m\)) odd

\(S_{mn}^{(2)}(c,\xi){=}\kappa_{m}^{(2)}(c)R_{m}^{(2)}(c,\xi)\)

\(\kappa_{m}^{(2)}(c){=}\frac{2^{n-m}(2m)!\left(\frac{n-m}{2}\right)!\left(\frac {n+m}{2}\right)!\;d_{2m}^{m}(c)}{(2m-1)m!(n+m)!c^{m-1}}\stackrel{{ \cong}}{{\longrightarrow}}\nu_{0}^{*}\), \(\frac{(2m+r)!}{r!}\stackrel{{\cong}}{{\longrightarrow}}\nu_{0}^{*}\), \(\frac{(2m+r)!}{r!}\stackrel{{\cong}}{{\longrightarrow}}\nu_{0}^{*}\)\((n-m)\) even \(=-\frac{2^{n-m}(2m)!\left(\frac{n-m-1}{2}\right)!\left(\frac{n+m+1}{2}\right)!\;d_{2 m+n}^{m}(c)}{(2m-3)(2m-1)m!(n+m+1)!\;c^{m-2}}\)\(\sum\limits_{r=1}^{n}\)\(\frac{(2m+r)!}{r!}\;d_{r}^{m}(c)\) (\(n-m\)) odd (The expression for joining factors appropriate to the oblate case may be obtained from the above formulas by the transformation \(e{\rightarrow}-ic\).)